{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"The project is a full SPHINCS+ implementation: 26 compiled C files across four hash backends, with 24 parameter headers and about 8,500 source/header lines. The selector axes are `HASH_BACKEND`, `THASH`, and `SECPAR`; I’m now extracting their exact compile behavior and API contracts before creating the manifest."}}
