{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_155","type":"agent_message","text":"The primitive mismatch is narrowed to another C quirk: BLAKE-256 increments its high counter only when the wrapped low counter becomes exactly zero, not on every arithmetic carry. That is why the empty vector matched but `\"abc\"` did not. I’m reproducing that condition exactly."}}
